<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIAN JUNE PPI FELL 0.3 PCT MO/MO,ROSE 6.7 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIAN JUNE PPI FELL 0.3 PCT MO/MO,ROSE 6.7 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's producer price</p>
<p>index in June fell by 0.3 percent month-on-month  and  rose by</p>
<p>6.7 percent year-on-year, the statistics department said in a</p>
<p>statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>    LITHUANIAN PPI		   June 97  May 97  June 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change (in PCT)  -0.3     -0.2    +0.2</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change (in PCT)    +6.7     +7.1   +18.5</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
